{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/74608b2c2ad4117363bdd92a27c2d0cf.avif?t=1751207675\" width=600 height=142 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/20dee7fd27c9f2cdf7deda816c1f334d.poster.avif?t=1751207675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/20dee7fd27c9f2cdf7deda816c1f334d.webm?t=1751207675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/20dee7fd27c9f2cdf7deda816c1f334d.mp4?t=1751207675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Command your Astrals in <strong>fast-paced, tactical battles.</strong> Queue abilities, adapt on the fly, and outplay your opponent in 1v1, 2v2, or full 3v3 team fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/7e4f08aa90df4a46bf8948c84efdf27a.avif?t=1751207675\" width=800 height=190 /></span><strong>Master the Modular Skill System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and reconfigure your Astrals\u2019 abilities with modular skill traits. Build precision combos, <strong>stack synergies,</strong> and tailor your team to any challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812890/extras/e54ce08e9abef74c6bf546ab49576ab8.avif?t=1751207675\" width=600 height=142 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l